      "text": "Verify token\n(or reader\ncredential)\n\nResolve caller:\nowner\n-> businessId\ncustomer\n-> customerId\nreader\n-> businessId\n\nAuthorize every\nread / write\n\nValidate input\n\n401 / 403 /\n400 on failure",
