      "type": "text",
      "x": 1960,
      "y": 1540,
      "width": 441,
      "height": 121.50000000000001,
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "Full card (e.g. 10/10) stays full; reward earned.\nNext punch -> NEW card with punches = 1.\nNo claim or redemption required; rewards stack.\nBusiness is notified: new card + reward waiting.\nExample: v1 = 10, v2 = 8. Card A (v1) still\nneeds 10; new and rollover cards use v2.",
      "originalText": "Full card (e.g. 10/10) stays full; reward earned.\nNext punch -> NEW card with punches = 1.\nNo claim or redemption required; rewards stack.\nBusiness is notified: new card + reward waiting.\nExample: v1 = 10, v2 = 8. Card A (v1) still\nneeds 10; new and rollover cards use v2.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
