      "width": 387,
      "height": 141.75,
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "Enrolled = lifetime unique customers,\nnot cards (cards roll over).\nActivity = from <= timestamp < to.\nEarned -> earnedAt; redeemed -> redeemedAt.\nRewards waiting = all-time unredeemed.\nApps pick periods in business time zone;\nAPI accepts UTC instants.",
      "originalText": "Enrolled = lifetime unique customers,\nnot cards (cards roll over).\nActivity = from <= timestamp < to.\nEarned -> earnedAt; redeemed -> redeemedAt.\nRewards waiting = all-time unredeemed.\nApps pick periods in business time zone;\nAPI accepts UTC instants.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
