      "width": 1857.6,
      "height": 24.3,
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "BOUNDARIES: one business + one active program per owner. No POS, employee roles, campaigns, or manual punch authorization. NFC readers never write to the database directly.",
      "originalText": "BOUNDARIES: one business + one active program per owner. No POS, employee roles, campaigns, or manual punch authorization. NFC readers never write to the database directly.",
